{"id": "3313589", "revid": "189968", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3313589", "title": "Nasdaq, Inc.", "text": "Nasdaq, Inc. este o corpora\u021bie multina\u021bional\u0103 american\u0103 de servicii financiare care furnizeaz\u0103 date, analize, software, capacit\u0103\u021bi de schimb \u0219i servicii de consultan\u021b\u0103 clien\u021bilor corporativi, managerilor de investi\u021bii, b\u0103ncilor, brokerilor \u0219i operatorilor de schimb din sistemul financiar global. Nasdaq a fost fondat\u0103 \u00een 1971 ca prima burs\u0103 electronic\u0103 din lume \u0219i a devenit public\u0103 \u00een 2000.\nCompania de\u021bine \u0219i opereaz\u0103 trei burse de valori \u00een Statele Unite: Bursa Nasdaq (pe care este \u0219i listat\u0103), Bursa din Philadelphia \u0219i Bursa din Boston, precum \u0219i \u0219apte burse de valori europene: Nasdaq Copenhaga, Nasdaq Helsinki, Nasdaq Islanda, Nasdaq Riga, Nasdaq Stockholm, Nasdaq Tallinn \u0219i Nasdaq Vilnius."}
